arks *</label><input name="previous_marks" type="number" step="0.01" min="0" class="form-control" required></div><div class="col-md-3"><label class="form-label">Total Marks *</label><input name="previous_total" type="number" step="0.01" min="1" class="form-control" required></div><div class="col-12"><div class="alert alert-info mb-0">Merit score is calculated automatically as previous marks ÷ total marks × 100. Final eligibility and merit rules must be verified against the applicable official admission policy.</div></div><div class="col-12"><button class="btn btn-primary px-4">Submit Application</button></div></form></div></div></div></div></div><?php require 'includes/footer.php';?>
